content:
Every time you get involved, you cause misery
for everyone around you! Isn't that right,
Shun-kun!?

Yes. His desire was not completely taken
from him, so as long as his passion persists,
I believe he'll be able to start anew.

"A timeless choice
for the outdoors:
military style!"

Not only that, I would have been devastated
if something were to have happened to you,
my dear.

I've been carrying the weight of this guilt
for so long... My mom and brother are dead,
and I'm the only one left here.

You're pretty calm for someone who's been
caught in the act. We have proof you did it;
there are cameras all around here...

I received a rare book
from Kurotani,
then we parted ways.

The two of us chatted
while planting seeds,
then I logged off.

Nya! There's another weird Shadow. Not sure
if it's the one that'll lead to our escape,
but...

Not so strong that we couldn't beat it. But
if this keeps up, things might get tough,
depending on our elemental matchups...

The fact that we're retracing all our steps
from the past must have some kind of meaning,
right?

Shoki Ikenami, pressed into a supporting role
for another school, but hard at work... Oh,
this article will be fantastic! Hehehe!

(That's right—I'll always wear my smile,
and tell lies over and over to save people
from being sad.)
